## Summary
Sixteen workers and citizens were transferred after staging a protest in the lobby of Sejong Hotel, demanding reinstatement. This incident indicates a labor dispute leading to legal consequences for the participants.

## Key Points
- Protest occurred at Sejong Hotel lobby
- Participants demanded reinstatement
- 16 individuals were involved
- Legal transfer of protesters to authorities
- Involvement of both workers and citizens


